<div id="primary" class="content-area">
    <main id="main" class="site-main">
        

            <article id="post-5177" class="entry-content post-5177 page type-page status-publish hentry post without-featured-image" >
                <div class="module_hero combo-hero-compact body-l alignfull content  full-width-media  compact-height image-right   ">
    <div class="section_wrapper bg-blocks">
                        <div class="bg-media-video object-fit">
                    <video playsinline="" webkit-playsinline="webkit-playsinline" autoplay muted loop id="myVideo">
                        <source src="https://capitolis.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/Web_Light_C_ROSEGOLD_2400x1200_03.0000-0500_1.mp4" type="video/mp4">
                        Your browser does not support HTML5 video.                    </video>
                </div>
                </div>
    <div class="grid-wrap block_col_2">
                <div class="col_desc body-l"  data-aos="fade" data-aos-delay="250" data-aos-duration="1500" >
            <h1 class="deco_underline text-black">Creating Safer and More Vibrant Capital Markets</h1>                        <div class="text-black">At Capitolis, we see huge untapped potential in the global economy, and we leverage our deep financial expertise and technical innovation to put that potential to work, enabling more organizations to drive growth the right way.  </div>        </div>
    </div>
</div>


<div class="module_hero combo-featured-media-with-text-pictogram body-l alignfull content hero-featured on-dark-bkg picto-small tall-height image-right flush-image-side  ">
    <div class="section_wrapper bg-blocks">
            </div>
    <div class="grid-wrap block_col_2">
                <div class="col_img object-fit "   data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1500" >
            <div class="img_hero">
                                        <img decoding="async" src="https://capitolis.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/GettyImages-1223359643.png" alt="" />
            </div>
        </div>
                <div class="col_desc body-l"  data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1500">
                        <h4 class="sub_heading text-white">What We Do</h4>            <div class="text-white"><p>We believe the best way to create capacity in the system is by helping banks reduce risk and use their capital more efficiently through a variety of portfolio optimization solutions, and where banks need capital, we help source some of it through our Capital Marketplace.</p></div>        </div>
    </div>
</div>


<div class="module_hero combo-hero-featured-media-with-text body-l alignfull content hero-featured full-width-media  tall-height image_left   bg_text-white">
    <div class="section_wrapper bg-blocks">
                            <div class="bg-media object-fit"><img decoding="async" src="https://capitolis.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/leading-by-example-desktop-2.png" alt="" /></div>
                    </div>
    <div class="grid-wrap block_col_2">
                <div class="col_desc body-l"  data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1500">
                        <h4 class="sub_heading text-white">Leading by Example</h4>            <div class="text-white">As we continue to grow, we recognize the importance of being a leader in sustainability and corporate social responsibility. From charitable causes to eco-friendly business practices, we’re working to make the world a better place. </div><a href="https://capitolis.com/purpose/" class="btn btn-primary btn-18 dark-button">LEARN MORE</a>                    </div>
    </div>
</div>


<div class="module_leadership body-l alignfull on-dark-bkg ">
    <div class="section_wrapper bg-blocks" >
            </div>
    <div class="grid-wrap head-leadership"  data-aos="fade-down" data-aos-duration="1500">
        <div class="head_divided">
            <h4 class="text-white">Our Founders</h4>
            <div class="text-white"><p><p>Capitolis is led by an experienced and passionate team of global financial and technology executives that are focused on transforming the financial system for the better</p></p></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-wrap slider_slick slider_lightbox slick-leadership">
                        <div class="card_profile btn-modal">
                    <div class="card_top">
                        <div class="photo_profile object-fit" style="background: url('https://capitolis.com/wp-content/plugins/sbx-genesis-collections//images/bg-card-leadership.png') center center no-repeat;">
                                                            <img decoding="async" src="https://capitolis.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/Gil.jpg" alt="">
                                                    </div>
                    </div>                    <div class="name_desig">
                        <h5>Gil Mandelzis</h5>
                        <h6>CEO &#038; Founder</h6>
                                            </div>
                    <div class="card_mid"><p><strong>Gil is CEO &amp; Founder of Capitolis. He is a serial entrepreneur with a successful record of creating transformational&nbsp;products and companies and leading them through global scaling.</strong></p>
<p>Prior to Capitolis, Gil was the CEO of EBS BrokerTec, NEX Group&rsquo;s (formerly ICAP&rsquo;s) foreign exchange and fixed income electronic markets business. He also served as a member of ICAP&rsquo;s Global Executive Management Group.</p>
<p>Before EBS BrokerTec, Gil was the CEO of Traiana, a post-trade processing company he founded in 2000. Gil led Traiana&rsquo;s growth from a small start-up to a recognized global leader, resulting in Traiana&rsquo;s acquisition by ICAP in 2007 for $250M. A Kellogg School of Management business case study was written about Gil and the success of Traiana.</p>
<p>Gil is a current member of the CFTC&#8217;s Global Market Structure Subcommittee and has been a member of the New York Federal Reserve&rsquo;s Foreign Exchange Committee, the Bank of England&rsquo;s Joint Standing Committee, and the Bank of Canada&rsquo;s Foreign Exchange Committee. He was recognized by Goldman Sachs as one of the Most Exceptional Entrepreneurs of 2025, awarded the e-FX achievement award by FX Week in 2012 in recognition of his lasting contribution to the development of the FX industry, and in 2013 was inducted into Profit &amp; Loss Magazine&lsquo;s Hall of Fame. In 2015 and 2016, Gil was named to Institutional Investor&rsquo;s prestigious Trading Technology 40 list.</p>
<p>Gil holds a Bachelor of Arts degree in Management and Sociology from Tel Aviv University (Magna Cum Laude) and a Master of Business Administration degree (With Distinction) from INSEAD in Fontainebleau, France. In 2012, Gil was the Keynote speaker at INSEAD&rsquo;s graduation ceremony.</p></div>
                </div>
                            <div class="card_profile btn-modal">
                    <div class="card_top">
                        <div class="photo_profile object-fit" style="background: url('https://capitolis.com/wp-content/plugins/sbx-genesis-collections//images/bg-card-leadership.png') center center no-repeat;">
                                                            <img decoding="async" src="https://capitolis.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/Tom_287x300-1.jpg" alt="">
                                                    </div>
                    </div>                    <div class="name_desig">
                        <h5>Tom Glocer</h5>
                        <h6>Executive Chairman &#038; Co-Founder</h6>
                                            </div>
                    <div class="card_mid"><p><strong>Tom is a Co-Founder of Capitolis and the Executive Chairman of the Board of Directors.&nbsp;</strong></p>
<p>Previously, Tom worked at Reuters Group PLC and its successor company, Thomson Reuters Corp. He served as CEO during his last 11 years at the news, professional information and financial services provider. Prior to Reuters he was a mergers and acquisitions lawyer at Davis Polk &amp; Wardwell in New York, Paris and Tokyo.</p>
<p>Tom is Executive Chair and Co-Founder of BlueVoyant and a Partner in Communitas Capital. He is also a director of Merck &amp; Co. (Lead Director), Morgan Stanley (Lead Director), Publicis Groupe, K2 Integrity and the Atlantic Council; and a trustee of the Cleveland Clinic and various alumni boards at Columbia and Yale Universities.</p>
<p>Tom holds a Bachelor of Arts degree in Political Science and Government from Columbia University and a J.D. degree from Yale Law School.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p></div>
                </div>
                </div>
            <div class="grid-wrap">
            <div class="btn-wrap">
                <a href="https://capitolis.com/leadership/">Meet Our Executive Leadership &#038; Board of Directors and Observers <span class="material-icons">east</span></a>
            </div>
        </div>
        </div>

